1
00:00:00,232 --> 00:00:02,482
(Beverley:)Thank you for taking us
to the airport.

2
00:00:02,484 --> 00:00:05,424
(Leonard:)Hey, I'm just thrilled we're all
getting along for a minute.

3
00:00:05,421 --> 00:00:06,551
(Alfred:)Yeah, me, too.

4
00:00:06,555 --> 00:00:09,205
(Alfred:)Beverly, I'm sorry
if I upset you.

5
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:10,858
(Beverley:)Water under the bridge, Alfred.

6
00:00:12,194 --> 00:00:14,364
(Beverley:)Leonard, why don't you get
into the carpool lane?

7
00:00:14,363 --> 00:00:16,283
(Alfred:)Well, that's a solid line.
He can't cross it.

8
00:00:16,281 --> 00:00:17,611
(Leonard:)That's okay.
I can make it over.

9
00:00:17,616 --> 00:00:18,996
(Beverley:)No, no, let's plod along.

10
00:00:19,001 --> 00:00:21,281
(Beverley:)It'll make your father feel
more comfortable.

11
00:00:22,838 --> 00:00:24,788
(Alfred:)What makes me comfortable
is knowing I don't have to

12
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:27,400
(Alfred:)wake up tomorrow morning
and see your sour face.

13
00:00:29,436 --> 00:00:31,676
Do the world a favor, and
don't wake up tomorrow morning.

14
00:00:35,302 --> 00:00:36,992
(Leonard:)That was almost a minute.

15
00:00:39,824 --> 00:00:42,164
(Mary:)There's a lot of traffic.
Are we gonna be okay?

16
00:00:42,335 --> 00:00:44,185
(Amy:)You'll be at the airport
an hour before your flight.

17
00:00:44,213 --> 00:00:45,053
(Randall (Penny's brother):)Good.
Thank you.

18
00:00:45,075 --> 00:00:50,025
(Sheldon:)Plenty of time for you to meet
another geriatric boy toy.

